                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "garbos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9a4b9d3-0d74-3fa5-9b75-2dc3ae7c8bdd",
                        "entry_id": "7f29d907-f360-35c2-b30d-ec12a8b59324",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rubbish collector; a garbage man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "countable",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8990aea8-d345-4d50-a336-93c89f005d85",
                                "sense_id": "b9a4b9d3-0d74-3fa5-9b75-2dc3ae7c8bdd",
                                "text": "Then believe it or not, I worked for some time as a garbo, collecting the rubbish in the wee hours of the morning."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13df5c3f-dc24-4516-9647-042a0c9f01dc",
                                "sense_id": "b9a4b9d3-0d74-3fa5-9b75-2dc3ae7c8bdd",
                                "text": "The referendum papers, accompanied by a strong statement of Council′s position, was to be letterboxed by the Council′s “garbos” (rubbish collectors) and inspectors on a Thursday and collected by volunteers over the weekend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b8b3678-0ee0-4452-8c86-5d067eee8063",
                                "sense_id": "b9a4b9d3-0d74-3fa5-9b75-2dc3ae7c8bdd",
                                "text": "As far as Jasper was concerned, his mum being a garbo was pretty cool. She got to drive a truck and be home in time to take his little sisters to school. Before she got the job as a rubbish collector, his mum had done shift work and it was left to Jasper to get his sisters to school."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2acf2c8a-11b4-4c5f-9385-ea153c815b57",
                                "sense_id": "b9a4b9d3-0d74-3fa5-9b75-2dc3ae7c8bdd",
                                "text": "The priest would bring salvation while the garbo took the rubbish."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aa845f9b-1991-3c3e-899d-14d58f329e5b",
                        "entry_id": "7f29d907-f360-35c2-b30d-ec12a8b59324",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Garbage; something considered worthless."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "colloquial",
                            "derogatory",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32e974ec-47af-47b8-9544-16d6f5845b82",
                                "sense_id": "aa845f9b-1991-3c3e-899d-14d58f329e5b",
                                "text": "\"Any quartz in the Mountain?\" / \"Just garbo quartz, not enough to produce any electrical fields.\" / \"No disruption in the magnetic field?\" / \"No, sir.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15b1b6ab-be20-4222-883d-b159ca9122b9",
                                "sense_id": "aa845f9b-1991-3c3e-899d-14d58f329e5b",
                                "text": "Then they beat me and burned me and locked me up, before handing me back like a piece of garbo, when I acted up or they got tired of me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ecde21d-9637-456d-9be2-93a4444dbe39",
                                "sense_id": "aa845f9b-1991-3c3e-899d-14d58f329e5b",
                                "text": "Another Twitter user wrote, \"I could lie to you and say that I'm totally not interested in that game [but] I am interested. It sucks so much that JKR is a transphobic piece of garbo. ... I think if I do play it, I'll make it clear in all promotions my feelings about JKR and also promote a trans charity for folks to donate their funds towards. Maybe it's not enough, and I might not have a lot of funds, but I do wanna use my voice to do what I can to support my trans friends.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ac3c78a-c7b0-409a-a877-83e9e8a4be05",
                                "sense_id": "aa845f9b-1991-3c3e-899d-14d58f329e5b",
                                "text": "Then Noelle told me she's a Paralympian and I was like, \"Well, my lie was just garbo. That was terrible. Noelle, you're a beast!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
